      "location": {
        "start": 171066,
        "end": 171067
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Fight Cauldron is a safe minigame unlocked after the Grandmaster quest The Brink of Extinction. Within the Fight Cauldron minigame, players battle with unlimited waves of TokHaar monsters who wish to test their might, and that of their opponent.",
      "location": {
        "start": 171067,
        "end": 171347
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 171347,
        "end": 171348
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 171348,
        "end": 171363
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 171363,
        "end": 171364
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• You will need a total of 228 obsidian shards to make every piece of obsidian equipment. On average, this will take 66 kills in the Cauldron.",
      "location": {
        "start": 171364,
        "end": 171520
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 171520,
        "end": 171521
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Full Obsidian armour is required for the TokHaar-Mok achievement.",
      "location": {
        "start": 171521,
        "end": 171602
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 171602,
        "end": 171603
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Fight Cauldron is also the fastest way to obtain weapon/armour drops for the Karamja slayer log.",
      "location": {
        "start": 171603,
        "end": 171715
      }
    },
    {
